---
import Layout from '../layout/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
		<h1>Research Survey</h1>
		<p>Welcome to the research survey page.</p>
		<p>This survey is voluntary and anonymous. Your responses will be kept confidential.</p>
		<p>Please complete the survey at your convenience.</p>
		<h2>GenAI and a Student's Motivation and Self-Efficacy</h2>
		<p>This section explores the relationship between generative AI tools and students' motivation and self-efficacy.</p>
		<p>Participants will be asked questions about their experiences with AI tools, their motivation towards going to school, and their confidence in performing academic tasks.</p>
		<p>These questions aim to understand if there is a relationship between a student's motivation, self-efficacy, and their use of generative AI tools.</p>
		<p>Thank you for participating in this survey.</p>
		<button type="button" onclick="window.location.href='/survey'">Start Survey</button>
</Layout>

<style>
	body {
		font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
		margin: 20px;
		background-color: #fbeeac;
	}
	h1 {
		color: #988558;
		text-align: center;
	}
	p {
		color: #666;
	}
	h2 {
		color: #988558;
	}
	button {
		align-self: center;
		display: block;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 10px 20px;
		background-color: #f5f5dc;
		color: #333;
		border: none;
		cursor: pointer;
	}
	button:hover {
		background-color: #e0e0d1;
	}
</style>